{"trial":1,"latency_seconds":3.88,"outcome":"SUPPORTED","candidate":{"outcome":"SUPPORTED","claims":[{"text":"The initiative would provide AHV old-age pension recipients with an additional annual payment equal to one twelfth of their annual pension, effectively adding a 13th pension payment each year.","fact_ids":["P01"]},{"text":"The government estimated that implementing this initiative would increase AHV spending by approximately CHF 4.1 billion per year, with costs rising to around CHF 5 billion five years after introduction.","fact_ids":["P02","P03"]}],"unknowns":[]},"review":{"entailed":true,"actor_correct":true,"time_correct":true,"uncertainty_preserved":true,"no_advice":true,"answers_question":true},"claims":[{"text":"The initiative would provide AHV old-age pension recipients with an additional annual payment equal to one twelfth of their annual pension, effectively adding a 13th pension payment each year.","fact_ids":["P01"],"citations":[{"actor":"GOVERNMENT","block_number":3,"end":1135,"identity_sha256":"8ac6e0fa1c5a02a4f80f63456def56c302035a592e272578457ba7e303651948","page_url":"https://www.bk.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/In9i5Kp4p64r/2024-03-03_erlaeuterungen_des_bundesrates.pdf#page=9","pdf_page":9,"span_id":"sp-8ac6e0fa1c5a02a4f80f","start":1027,"text":"Die Initiative fordert, dass die monatliche Rente nicht nur 12 Mal, sondern 13 Mal pro Jahr ausbezahlt wird.","text_sha256":"d34cf1a2af61f1828459fb696b1a808b5ccd237470082a64c77d2b0061f96b66"},{"actor":"GOVERNMENT","block_number":4,"end":720,"identity_sha256":"df2d2f588ab3cde53e29b712a21f38c42c2ea8be568d2497ed58da89dea0f70c","page_url":"https://www.bk.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/In9i5Kp4p64r/2024-03-03_erlaeuterungen_des_bundesrates.pdf#page=4","pdf_page":4,"span_id":"sp-df2d2f588ab3cde53e29","start":661,"text":"Zu den 12 Monatsrenten käme jedes Jahr eine 13. Rente dazu.","text_sha256":"bc048891774a398e49844ccdef2bd02928c1dbb850e6c53f8c6627e794874bc8"}],"evidence_kinds":["DIRECT_PROVISION"]},{"text":"The government estimated that implementing this initiative would increase AHV spending by approximately CHF 4.1 billion per year, with costs rising to around CHF 5 billion five years after introduction.","fact_ids":["P02","P03"],"citations":[{"actor":"GOVERNMENT","block_number":2,"end":672,"identity_sha256":"f2d89f437b4fb79c22167caf74655564fe87a459f72e4f1995d6da1fc719e2f0","page_url":"https://www.bk.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/In9i5Kp4p64r/2024-03-03_erlaeuterungen_des_bundesrates.pdf#page=11","pdf_page":11,"span_id":"sp-f2d89f437b4fb79c2216","start":566,"text":"Die 13. AHV-Rente würde bei der Einführung voraussichtlich etwa 4,1 Milliarden Franken zusätzlich kosten.2","text_sha256":"c3c9beecb067abe982749da32b306137228037e87db62aae3573bf2a768f55c3"},{"actor":"GOVERNMENT","block_number":4,"end":1179,"identity_sha256":"9acf2ebeaa24c5dacbab8d3529791492147871467515527cac8b08cb2bf0c802","page_url":"https://www.bk.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/In9i5Kp4p64r/2024-03-03_erlaeuterungen_des_bundesrates.pdf#page=4","pdf_page":4,"span_id":"sp-9acf2ebeaa24c5dacbab","start":986,"text":"Durch diese Erhöhung würden die Kosten für die 13. AHV- Rente bei der Einführung voraussichtlich etwa 4,1 Milliarden Franken betragen; davon müsste der Bund rund 800 Millionen Franken bezahlen.","text_sha256":"b4d63038683014b09f8677ac2f3caff1541db22bd0ae8be20ae7067717f04c09"},{"actor":"GOVERNMENT","block_number":2,"end":965,"identity_sha256":"2275e83fa97bea1e8eee821b3a0e4f4008d67601ccb4368b8d84f19aceb1be19","page_url":"https://www.bk.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/In9i5Kp4p64r/2024-03-03_erlaeuterungen_des_bundesrates.pdf#page=11","pdf_page":11,"span_id":"sp-2275e83fa97bea1e8eee","start":869,"text":"Fünf Jahre nach Einführung würden die Kosten voraussichtlich rund 5 Milliarden Franken betragen.","text_sha256":"67afcf5a0024f29bfbc7a58c2a6bd3b21a5da54e3158a58369cd5de2c6360951"}],"evidence_kinds":["COST_PROJECTION"]}]}
